## Recipe Book

### Recipe Structure

```xiom
type Ingredient {
  name: Str;
  quantity: Int;
  unit: Str;
}

type Recipe {
  id: Int;
  name: Str;
  servings: Int;
  prep_time: Int;
  ingredients: Vec[Ingredient];
  instructions: Str;
  tags: Vec[Str];
}

type Cookbook {
  recipes: Vec[Recipe];
  next_id: Int;
}
```

### Adding Recipes

```xiom
fn add_recipe(book: &mut Cookbook, name: Str, servings: Int, prep_time: Int, instructions: Str) -> Int {
  let recipe = Recipe{
    id: book.next_id,
    name: name,
    servings: servings,
    prep_time: prep_time,
    ingredients: Vec[Ingredient].new(),
    instructions: instructions,
    tags: Vec[Str].new()
  };
  book.recipes.push(recipe);
  book.next_id += 1;
  book.next_id - 1
}

fn add_ingredient(book: &mut Cookbook, recipe_id: Int, name: Str, quantity: Int, unit: Str) -> Bool {
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < book.recipes.len() {
    let recipe = book.recipes.get(i).unwrap();
    if recipe.id == recipe_id {
      let mut r = recipe.clone();
      r.ingredients.push(Ingredient{ name: name, quantity: quantity, unit: unit });
      book.recipes.set(i, r);
      return true;
    };
    i += 1;
  };
  false
}
```

### Search

```xiom
fn search_by_name(book: &Cookbook, query: Str) -> Vec<Recipe> {
  let mut results: Vec[Recipe] = Vec[Recipe].new();
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < book.recipes.len() {
    let r = book.recipes.get(i).unwrap();
    if r.name.contains(query) {
      results.push(r.clone());
    };
    i += 1;
  };
  results
}

fn search_by_ingredient(book: &Cookbook, ingredient: Str) -> Vec<Recipe> {
  let mut results: Vec[Recipe] = Vec[Recipe].new();
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < book.recipes.len() {
    let r = book.recipes.get(i).unwrap();
    let mut j = 0;
    let mut found = false;
    while j < r.ingredients.len() {
      if r.ingredients.get(j).unwrap().name.contains(ingredient) {
        found = true;
        break;
      };
      j += 1;
    };
    if found { results.push(r.clone()); };
    i += 1;
  };
  results
}
```

### Scaling

```xiom
fn scale_recipe(recipe: &Recipe, new_servings: Int) -> Recipe {
  let ratio = new_servings / recipe.servings;
  let mut scaled = recipe.clone();
  scaled.servings = new_servings;

  let mut i = 0;
  while i < scaled.ingredients.len() {
    let ing = scaled.ingredients.get(i).unwrap();
    scaled.ingredients.set(i, Ingredient{
      name: ing.name.clone(),
      quantity: ing.quantity * ratio,
      unit: ing.unit.clone()
    });
    i += 1;
  };
  scaled
}
```

### Quick Dinners (Filter by Time)

```xiom
fn quick_recipes(book: &Cookbook, max_time: Int) -> Vec[Recipe] {
  let mut results: Vec[Recipe] = Vec[Recipe].new();
  let mut i = 0;
  while i < book.recipes.len() {
    let r = book.recipes.get(i).unwrap();
    if r.prep_time <= max_time {
      results.push(r.clone());
    };
    i += 1;
  };
  results
}
